u}<0.072{\,m eV}\quad\mbox{	ext{\parbox{113.81102pt}{ egin{flushleft}(95\,\%,~DESI~BAO+CMB). \end{flushleft}}}}ight.$ (40) The left panel of Figure 12 shows the corresponding 1D marginalised posteriors. The posterior peaks at $\sum m_{
