We also caution that the upper bound obtained is strongly dependent on the choice of prior for $\sum m_{
u}$. While we have deliberately chosen to use $\sum m_{
u}>0{\,m eV}$ for our primary analysis, one can also impose physically motivated priors corresponding specifically to the NH ( $\sum m_{
