u}<0.145{\,m eV}\quad\mbox{	ext{\parbox{113.81102pt}{ egin{flushleft}(95\,\%,~DESI~BAO+CMB; $\sum m_{
u}>0.10$~eV). \end{flushleft}}}}ight.$ (42) Cosmological results alone do not yet strongly favour the NH over the IH: through comparing the best fits to the data obtained with $\sum m_{
u}=0.059$ eV and $\sum m_{
